@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Activity view · DevSecOps checks and hosted delivery
skinparam defaultFontSize 23
skinparam activityFontSize 23
skinparam ArrowFontSize 20
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F5F2E9
skinparam activityBorderColor #75528F
skinparam partitionBorderColor #C7BCA7
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 15
skinparam Padding 6
skinparam LegendFontSize 22
partition "Developer" {
  (*) --> "Commit / PR to dev\nPush protection rejects secrets" as PR
}
partition "GitHub PR checks" {
  PR -right-> ===checks===
  ===checks=== -right-> "BLOCKS MERGE · Quality\nstatic ×4; tests + fixtures\nSQLite + PostgreSQL; Jest ≥70%\nSCA: npm audit HIGH+\n→ quality-test-results-root\n→ server-coverage\n→ frontend-coverage\n→ quality-npm-audit" as Q
  ===checks=== --> "REPORTS · parallel workflows\nSAST CodeQL → Security\nGitleaks → gitleaks-<sha>\nTrivy images + SBOM →\nrelease-security-{runtime,web}-<sha>\nIaC → release-security-iac-<sha>\nGitGuardian app → PR status\nGitHub secrets / Dependabot → alerts" as REPORT
}
partition "Deploy dev" {
  Q -right-> "Merge → push dev\nBLOCKS DEPLOY: Quality + Trivy\nSame-commit Quality; build / verify tar\nExact-bundle Trivy: HIGH / CRITICAL\n→ sbom-{runtime,web}.cdx.json\n→ trivy-{runtime,web}.json\n→ release-manifest.json\narchive: dev-release-security-<sha>" as SCAN
  SCAN --> "Attest tar + manifest\n→ Sigstore JSON bundle\n→ dev-release-bundle-<sha>\nOIDC → SSH upload" as SIGN
}
partition "Hosted dev" {
  SCAN -[hidden]right-> "Install + health check\nBLOCKS DEPLOY: bad health\nRestore previous on failure" as HOST
  SIGN -right-> HOST
  HOST --> "REPORTS · ZAP baseline\n→ zap-baseline-<sha>\nreport_json.json\nreport_html.html / report_md.md" as ZAP
  ZAP --> (*)
}
legend bottom
  BLOCKS MERGE = required Quality. BLOCKS DEPLOY = stops upload / activation. REPORTS = outside both gates.
  PR + push: Quality, CodeQL, Gitleaks; CodeQL also weekly. Candidate scans: path-filtered PR, dev/main push, v*, manual.
  Deploy: dev push / manual; docs-only skips host work and app checks. Main adds browser checks to Quality.
  Manual performance REPORTS → hosted-performance-<run-id>: results.json + SUMMARY.md. Independent scans can fail their jobs.
endlegend
@enduml
